    MC @ serious "Centrémonos en la maldita misión."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TheComingStorm/scr_TheComingStorm_aio.rpy:1393
translate es qst_thecomingstorm_poltrik_family_estate_3c1f7fb0:

    # "...Upon arriving at the house, the air felt wrong."
    "...Al llegar a la casa, el aire se sentía raro."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TheComingStorm/scr_TheComingStorm_aio.rpy:1394
translate es qst_thecomingstorm_poltrik_family_estate_15f1df38:

    # "Not a single light flickered within the darkened windows."
    "Ni una sola luz parpadeaba dentro de las oscuras ventanas."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TheComingStorm/scr_TheComingStorm_aio.rpy:1395
translate es qst_thecomingstorm_poltrik_family_estate_83a9be09:

    # "The curtains were drawn, and the home sat eerily still."
    "Las cortinas estaban echadas y la casa permanecía en un silencio inquietante."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TheComingStorm/scr_TheComingStorm_aio.rpy:1396
translate es qst_thecomingstorm_poltrik_family_estate_825c7592:

    # "The front yard, once well-kept, had been left to ruin—the grass growing wild, untamed."
    "El patio delantero, antes bien cuidado, se había dejado en ruinas, la hierba crecía salvaje, indómita."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TheComingStorm/scr_TheComingStorm_aio.rpy:1398
translate es qst_thecomingstorm_poltrik_family_estate_3467155c:

    # "A cold wind swept through the empty streets, and with it came a sensation that clawed at the back of my mind."
    "Un viento frío recorrió las calles vacías, y con él llegó una sensación que arañaba el fondo de mi mente."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TheComingStorm/scr_TheComingStorm_aio.rpy:1399
translate es qst_thecomingstorm_poltrik_family_estate_f5e3d737:

    # "{i}Something was wrong here.{/i}"
    "{i}Algo iba mal aquí.{/i}"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TheComingStorm/scr_TheComingStorm_aio.rpy:1401
translate es qst_thecomingstorm_poltrik_family_estate_12329a47:

    # "Then, the scent hit me."
    "Entonces, me llegó el olor."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TheComingStorm/scr_TheComingStorm_aio.rpy:1402
translate es qst_thecomingstorm_poltrik_family_estate_fa9c65f9:

    # "That putrid, rotting stench. The same one I had smelled before."
    "Ese hedor pútrido y putrefacto. El mismo que había olido antes."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TheComingStorm/scr_TheComingStorm_aio.rpy:1403
translate es qst_thecomingstorm_poltrik_family_estate_e0c2dff4:

    # "It seeped from the very walls of the house. Sickly sweet. Overpowering."
    "Se filtraba desde las mismas paredes de la casa. Enfermizamente dulce. Abrumador."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TheComingStorm/scr_TheComingStorm_aio.rpy:1404
translate es qst_thecomingstorm_poltrik_family_estate_8b582965:

    # MARKUS @ think "You smell it... right?"
    MARKUS @ think "Lo hueles... ¿verdad?"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TheComingStorm/scr_TheComingStorm_aio.rpy:1405
translate es qst_thecomingstorm_poltrik_family_estate_73c488a9:

    # MC @ serious "Yeah."
    MC @ serious "Sí."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TheComingStorm/scr_TheComingStorm_aio.rpy:1406
translate es qst_thecomingstorm_poltrik_family_estate_9c7b13ad:

    # MC @ serious "We move carefully."
    MC @ serious "Avanzaremos con cuidado."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TheComingStorm/scr_TheComingStorm_aio.rpy:1407
translate es qst_thecomingstorm_poltrik_family_estate_ebc93d9c:

    # "As we approached the wooden door, we considered our options."
    "Al acercarnos a la puerta de madera, consideramos nuestras opciones."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TheComingStorm/scr_TheComingStorm_aio.rpy:1410
translate es qst_thecomingstorm_poltrik_family_estate_menu_c514dfa9:

    # "I rapped my knuckles against the wood a couple times."
    "Golpeé mis nudillos contra la madera un par de veces."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TheComingStorm/scr_TheComingStorm_aio.rpy:1412
translate es qst_thecomingstorm_poltrik_family_estate_menu_97d7e1ff:

    # "...Nothing."
    "...Nada."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TheComingStorm/scr_TheComingStorm_aio.rpy:1413
translate es qst_thecomingstorm_poltrik_family_estate_menu_3761ed9c:

    # MARKUS @ think "{i}...Were you really expecting that to work?{/i}"
    MARKUS @ think "{i}...¿Realmente esperabas que eso funcionara?{/i}"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TheComingStorm/scr_TheComingStorm_aio.rpy:1417
translate es qst_thecomingstorm_poltrik_family_estate_menu_b660f325:

    # "I grabbed the handle and twisted."
    "Cogí el picaporte y lo giré."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TheComingStorm/scr_TheComingStorm_aio.rpy:1419
translate es qst_thecomingstorm_poltrik_family_estate_menu_04752cdf:

    # "Unsurprisingly, it was locked."
    "Como era de esperar, estaba cerrada."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TheComingStorm/scr_TheComingStorm_aio.rpy:1426
translate es qst_thecomingstorm_poltrik_family_estate_menu_05534a52:

    # "With a sharp, hard boot, the door slammed open, the hinges groaning in protest."
    "Con una fuerte y afilada bota, la puerta se abrió de golpe, las bisagras gimieron en señal de protesta."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TheComingStorm/scr_TheComingStorm_aio.rpy:1427
translate es qst_thecomingstorm_poltrik_family_estate_menu_3d637ddb:

    # MARKUS @ talk "Well... That's one way to announce our arrival."
    MARKUS @ talk "Bueno... Esa es una forma de anunciar nuestra llegada."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TheComingStorm/scr_TheComingStorm_aio.rpy:1428
translate es qst_thecomingstorm_poltrik_family_estate_menu_4becea67:

    # MC @ think "Did you have a better idea?"
    MC @ think "¿Tenías una idea mejor?"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TheComingStorm/scr_TheComingStorm_aio.rpy:1429
translate es qst_thecomingstorm_poltrik_family_estate_menu_b61b131f:

    # MARKUS @ talk "Sure. We torch the place from the outside and then head to the Iron—"
    MARKUS @ talk "Claro. Incendiamos el lugar desde el exterior y luego nos dirigimos al Unicornio—"
# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TheComingStorm/scr_TheComingStorm_aio.rpy:1434
translate es qst_thecomingstorm_poltrik_family_estate_menu_55ac44c5:

    # "Taking one of the hair pins, I knelt down and fiddled with the lock for a while."
    "Cogí una de las horquillas, me arrodillé y trasteé un rato con la cerradura."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TheComingStorm/scr_TheComingStorm_aio.rpy:1435
translate es qst_thecomingstorm_poltrik_family_estate_menu_e57905ec:

    # "Markus raised a brow as he watched me work, no doubt curious as to where I learned such a trick."
    "Markus enarcó una ceja mientras me observaba, sin duda curioso por saber dónde había aprendido semejante truco."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TheComingStorm/scr_TheComingStorm_aio.rpy:1436
translate es qst_thecomingstorm_poltrik_family_estate_menu_1a1cfcb9:

    # "As the door 'clicked' I turned the lock and gently pushed the door open."
    "Cuando la puerta hizo 'clic', giré la cerradura y empujé suavemente la puerta para abrirla."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TheComingStorm/scr_TheComingStorm_aio.rpy:1440
translate es qst_thecomingstorm_poltrik_family_estate_menu_f6afc786:

    # MARKUS @ talk "... Good enough for me."
    MARKUS @ talk "... Suficiente para mí."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TheComingStorm/scr_TheComingStorm_aio.rpy:1448
translate es qst_thecomingstorm_poltrik_family_estate_menu_c4f7511a:

    # "The two of us froze."
    "Los dos nos quedamos helados."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TheComingStorm/scr_TheComingStorm_aio.rpy:1449
translate es qst_thecomingstorm_poltrik_family_estate_menu_9e5027ce:

    # "As the door swung open, we were met with a vision from a nightmare."
    "Cuando la puerta se abrió, nos encontramos con una especie de pesadilla."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TheComingStorm/scr_TheComingStorm_aio.rpy:1450
translate es qst_thecomingstorm_poltrik_family_estate_menu_01b83f04:

    # "The once-grand interior had been reduced to a butcher's slaughterhouse."
    "El interior, antaño grandioso, había quedado reducido a un matadero."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TheComingStorm/scr_TheComingStorm_aio.rpy:1451
translate es qst_thecomingstorm_poltrik_family_estate_menu_90b7cdac:

    # "Skinless corpses hung upside down from the ceiling, stripped to bare muscle and bone."
    "Del techo colgaban cadáveres sin piel, despojados de músculos y huesos."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TheComingStorm/scr_TheComingStorm_aio.rpy:1452
translate es qst_thecomingstorm_poltrik_family_estate_menu_c4be4c76:

    # "Blood pooled across the marble floor, seeping through the cracks, thick and dark."
    "La sangre se extendía por el suelo de mármol, filtrándose por las grietas, espesa y oscura."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TheComingStorm/scr_TheComingStorm_aio.rpy:1453
translate es qst_thecomingstorm_poltrik_family_estate_menu_41064796:

    # "The walls—once adorned with noble decorations—were now drenched in red, clawed apart by something inhuman."
    "Las paredes—antes adornadas con nobles decoraciones—estaban ahora empapadas de rojo, arañadas por algo inhumano."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TheComingStorm/scr_TheComingStorm_aio.rpy:1455
translate es qst_thecomingstorm_poltrik_family_estate_menu_82745b70:

    # "Markus clamped a hand over his mouth, struggling to contain the bile rising in his throat."
    "Markus se tapó la boca con una mano, luchando por contener la bilis que le subía por la garganta."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TheComingStorm/scr_TheComingStorm_aio.rpy:1456
translate es qst_thecomingstorm_poltrik_family_estate_menu_69ce6828:

    # MC @ serious "{i}What... the fuck is this?{/i}"
    MC @ serious "{i}¿Qué... demonios es esto?{/i}"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TheComingStorm/scr_TheComingStorm_aio.rpy:1458
translate es qst_thecomingstorm_poltrik_family_estate_menu_29ff1ca2:

    # "At the center of the room, where a dining table might have once stood, a grotesque mound of flesh sat piled high."
    "En el centro de la habitación, donde antes podía haber una mesa de comedor, se apilaba un grotesco montón de carne."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TheComingStorm/scr_TheComingStorm_aio.rpy:1460
translate es qst_thecomingstorm_poltrik_family_estate_menu_86287958:

    # "Intestines. Organs. Skin. Dumped in a heap."
    "Intestinos. Órganos. Piel. Tirados en un montón."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TheComingStorm/scr_TheComingStorm_aio.rpy:1461
translate es qst_thecomingstorm_poltrik_family_estate_menu_896249e0:

    # "Flies buzzed in an unholy symphony, circling the monstrous offering."
    "Las moscas zumbaban en una sinfonía siniestra, rodeando la monstruosa ofrenda."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TheComingStorm/scr_TheComingStorm_aio.rpy:1462
translate es qst_thecomingstorm_poltrik_family_estate_menu_0b5a34ed:

    # MARKUS @ scared "What kind of nightmare is this?!"
    MARKUS @ scared "¡¿Qué clase de pesadilla es esta?!"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TheComingStorm/scr_TheComingStorm_aio.rpy:1463
translate es qst_thecomingstorm_poltrik_family_estate_menu_0cb12ff6:

    # "Then, our eyes lifted to the ceiling."
    "Entonces, nuestros ojos se alzaron hacia el techo."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TheComingStorm/scr_TheComingStorm_aio.rpy:1464
translate es qst_thecomingstorm_poltrik_family_estate_menu_7e834076:

    # "Dark green, bulbous eggs clung to the rafters, pulsating softly."
    "Huevos bulbosos de color verde oscuro se aferraban a las vigas, palpitando suavemente."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TheComingStorm/scr_TheComingStorm_aio.rpy:1465
translate es qst_thecomingstorm_poltrik_family_estate_menu_74ae2451:

    # "Each was the size of a child, their slimy shells shifting as something inside pressed against the walls."
    "Cada uno tenía el tamaño de un niño, y sus caparazones viscosos se movían cuando algo en su interior presionaba contra las paredes."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TheComingStorm/scr_TheComingStorm_aio.rpy:1468
translate es qst_thecomingstorm_poltrik_family_estate_menu_1334cad7:

    # MYU @ scared "H-Home! We go home!"
    MYU @ scared "¡C-casa! ¡Vamos a casa!"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TheComingStorm/scr_TheComingStorm_aio.rpy:1469
translate es qst_thecomingstorm_poltrik_family_estate_menu_de377bd4:

    # MYU @ scared "Myu no like!"
    MYU @ scared "¡Myu no gustar!"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TheComingStorm/scr_TheComingStorm_aio.rpy:1470
translate es qst_thecomingstorm_poltrik_family_estate_menu_d47b469c:

    # MC @ serious "Calm yourself, Myu."
    MC @ serious "Cálmate, Myu."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TheComingStorm/scr_TheComingStorm_aio.rpy:1474
translate es qst_thecomingstorm_poltrik_family_estate_menu_d77bc44c:

    # ELENA @ angry "I don't like this... We should wait for Captain Nyx and the other guards."
    ELENA @ angry "No me gusta esto... Deberíamos esperar a la Capitana Nyx y a los otros guardias."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TheComingStorm/scr_TheComingStorm_aio.rpy:1484
translate es qst_thecomingstorm_poltrik_family_estate_snuckin_149dbee7:

    # MC @ serious "Now... While we have the element of surprise, we can kill them while they sleep."
    MC @ serious "Ahora... Mientras tengamos el elemento sorpresa, podemos matarlos mientras duermen."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TheComingStorm/scr_TheComingStorm_aio.rpy:1485
translate es qst_thecomingstorm_poltrik_family_estate_snuckin_32187107:

    # MARKUS @ angry "Now would have been a lovely time for someone here to have some fire magecraft... But I guess our blades will do."
    MARKUS @ angry "Ahora habría sido un buen momento para que alguien aquí tuviera algo de magia de fuego... Pero supongo que nuestras cuchillas servirán."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TheComingStorm/scr_TheComingStorm_aio.rpy:1488
translate es qst_thecomingstorm_poltrik_family_estate_snuckin_0f510ccb:

    # "The others nodded sheepishly, as each of us carefully found one of those wretching pulsing sacks of flesh."
    "Los demás asintieron tímidamente, mientras cada uno de nosotros encontraba con cuidado uno de esos sacos de carne palpitante."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TheComingStorm/scr_TheComingStorm_aio.rpy:1489
translate es qst_thecomingstorm_poltrik_family_estate_snuckin_b7834ded:

    # "Timed just right, each of us destroyed the sacks and killed the wretched, sleeping creatures inside one by one."
    "En el momento justo, cada uno de nosotros destruyó los sacos y mató una a una a las desdichadas criaturas que dormían en su interior."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TheComingStorm/scr_TheComingStorm_aio.rpy:1490
translate es qst_thecomingstorm_poltrik_family_estate_snuckin_67f47e67:

    # "One tried to scream, awakening at just the right moment, but as the blade sliced across it's throat only a gargled bloody choke escape it's lips."
    "Una de ellas trató de gritar, despertando en el momento justo, pero cuando la hoja le atravesó la garganta solo se escapó de sus labios una gárgara sangrienta."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TheComingStorm/scr_TheComingStorm_aio.rpy:1491
translate es qst_thecomingstorm_poltrik_family_estate_snuckin_63d21d99:

    # "As we worked through in our silent slaughter, a voice suddenly boomed."
    "Mientras trabajábamos en nuestra matanza silenciosa, una voz retumbó de repente."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TheComingStorm/scr_TheComingStorm_aio.rpy:1492
translate es qst_thecomingstorm_poltrik_family_estate_snuckin_282795e0:

    # POLTRIK "{i}Murderers...{/i}"
    POLTRIK "{i}Asesinos...{/i}"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TheComingStorm/scr_TheComingStorm_aio.rpy:1494
translate es qst_thecomingstorm_poltrik_family_estate_snuckin_2f70fbff:

    # "We stopped in our bloody work to look around."
    "Nos detuvimos en nuestro sangriento trabajo para mirar a nuestro alrededor."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TheComingStorm/scr_TheComingStorm_aio.rpy:1496
translate es qst_thecomingstorm_poltrik_family_estate_snuckin_8fac6bff:

    # POLTRIK "{i}You think this has aided your cause?{/i}"
    POLTRIK "{i}¿Crees que esto ha ayudado a tu causa?{/i}"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TheComingStorm/scr_TheComingStorm_aio.rpy:1497
translate es qst_thecomingstorm_poltrik_family_estate_snuckin_5c8f4641:

    # POLTRIK "{i}We are inevitable.{/i}"
    POLTRIK "{i}Somos inevitables.{/i}"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TheComingStorm/scr_TheComingStorm_aio.rpy:1498
translate es qst_thecomingstorm_poltrik_family_estate_snuckin_9f87f1dc:

    # POLTRIK "{i}God has shown us the way!{/i}"
    POLTRIK "{i}¡Dios nos ha mostrado el camino!{/i}"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TheComingStorm/scr_TheComingStorm_aio.rpy:1503
translate es qst_thecomingstorm_poltrik_family_estate_kickedopen_5c7b731b:

    # POLTRIK "{i}...You should have left us alone.{/i}"
    POLTRIK "{i}...Deberías habernos dejado en paz.{/i}"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TheComingStorm/scr_TheComingStorm_aio.rpy:1504
translate es qst_thecomingstorm_poltrik_family_estate_kickedopen_6027bd03:

    # "Hand on my sword hilt, I scanned the shadows."
    "Con la mano en la empuñadura de mi espada, escudriñé las sombras."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TheComingStorm/scr_TheComingStorm_aio.rpy:1505
translate es qst_thecomingstorm_poltrik_family_estate_kickedopen_a3c6d5de:

    # MC @ angry "Who are you, really?!"
    MC @ angry "¡¿Quién eres, en realidad?!"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TheComingStorm/scr_TheComingStorm_aio.rpy:1506
translate es qst_thecomingstorm_poltrik_family_estate_kickedopen_e8fe007d:

